      821       then do:
      822           for each buf_right_temp_actntw_items
      823              where buf_right_temp_actntw_items.selRight = yes
      824           :
      825               assign
      826                   buf_right_temp_actntw_items.itmSelected = yes
      827                   buf_right_temp_actntw_items.selRight    = no
      828               .
      829           end.
      830           br-table-right :refresh().
      831           run local-open-query-left in this-procedure .
      832           find first buf_temp_actntw_items
      833                where buf_temp_actntw_items.itmSelected = no
      834           no-error.
      835           if available buf_temp_actntw_items
      836           then do:
      837               apply "entry" to br-table-right.
